{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/b/30bc8bacb35f931cf5a493e8f2325471d06f4253.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{1}{4}y+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c34717bc9c86346d0a44a9c3deae5cfd76fede0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{1}{4}x+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" /> intersect at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22c7cd2677e2f85d9ba8fef4ff02f34b9edc88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 0\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{3}{4}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 1\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 2\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{9}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"363\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> is a solution to both equations, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> will give the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f081f33c4692b28531f3aa25bf2633d53ca0c600.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot 2 + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"100\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584468cd4c65823de9a250fe030f827bce3f7a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/9/539069c7b7383701305774a6d71f1fbfc037b723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot 1 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"99\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/852d8a51603987296adacdafc7241c566834e6c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{7}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/a/6ba36665e106ea8e7510dd165e5186562e2ec7cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{7}{4} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }\\frac{9}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"196\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> into the equations gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/1895fd64da1fec6d1a889b4a9b5241d2ae9aab8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1=\\frac{2}{4}+a\\quad\\text{and}\\quad 2=\\frac{1}{4}+b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"222\" height=\"38\" /> It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b9fb6e49fae78d7d9cdc1995d9e5c9f51fe167b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=\\left(1-\\frac{2}{4}\\right)+\\left(2-\\frac{1}{4}\\right)=3 - \\frac{3}{4}=\\boxed{\\frac{9}{4}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"351\" height=\"49\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04f3edc49785948dcb18ca45ab191fe523abf41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x- \\frac{y}{4}\\quad\\text{and}\\quad b=y-\\frac{x}{4} \\quad\\text{we have}\\quad a +b = \\frac{3}{4}(x+y).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"449\" height=\"38\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/a/40ac4b6f5ab516ac6fe7132ed2fe7a1d77ca02dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />, this implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb74fa3f7c6e33b1da38ead312615ee152047018.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\frac{3}{4}(1 + 2) = \\boxed{\\frac{9}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"182\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q1mxhiyciSk\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q1mxhiyciSk</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr